  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Palestinian Health System Reform Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to improve access to quality health services sustainably and efficiently for the Palestinian population through i) improving population, service, and financial coverage; ii) strengthening purchasing of services from referral receiving hospitals; and iii) scaling up preventive service delivery capacity at public primary health facilities. Within these components, the project would support improving access to high quality health services in a sustainable manner at health facilities through rationalizing referral pathways; improving the availability of essential medicines; and strengthening purchasing capacity.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contribute to improvements in the efficiency, sustainability, and quality of the Palestinian health system</narrative>
  </description>
